# Narration WAVs: 22MB of generated audio, reproducible with `npm run tts` for a
# few pence of Cloud TTS. What is NOT reproducible is the LENGTH of each file,
# because a re-synthesis can differ by milliseconds and the picture is laid out
# from those lengths. So the audio is ignored and
# src/lesson-film/timings/*.json IS committed: the films stay reproducible
# frame for frame even if every WAV is regenerated.
